# UI overlay painting as the default (present_ui_overlay): presents per swap
# with no presenter UI, then with the F4 settings overlay, an achievement
# pop-up (toast: shown, not unlocked) and the console overlay. Run with
# --presentmon --present-log, present_ui_overlay on and off.
wait 8s
mark title
press_until start left_title every=2s timeout=90s
mark map_zoom
wait_until roam 180s
mark settle
wait 3s
trigger rt 0.5
stick lx 0.15
mark plain
wait 12s
key F4
mark settings
wait 10s
key F4
mark settings_closed
wait 3s
toast
mark toast
wait 4s
mark toast_gone
wait 3s
key Backtick
mark console
wait 10s
key Backtick
mark console_closed
wait 4s
release all
mark end
wait 1s
